# CI lock for the demos workflow. requirements.txt stays the human-facing
# install line and the single place the floors live; this file adds pytest and
# httpx (starlette's TestClient, used by tests/test_request_hardening.py) on
# top of it. Installed with --require-hashes. Compile with:
#   uv pip compile requirements/ci.in --generate-hashes --universal \
#     --python-version 3.11 -o requirements/ci.txt
-r ../requirements.txt
